  "equipment_type": "VRF / split AC gateway",
  "applies_to": "Intesis Modbus Server - Mitsubishi Heavy Industries AC, order codes INMBSMHI128O000 (128 units, Superlink-II) and INMBSMHI048O000 (48 units, Superlink-I or II), user's manual r1.0 (05/2012).",
  "summary": "Gateway that sits on the Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Superlink bus and exposes up to 128 (or 48) indoor units as a fixed Modbus map: 20 registers per unit address with on/off, mode, setpoint, fan, louver, room temperature, error and lock, plus a few all-unit commands. Modbus RTU (RS-485 or RS-232) and Modbus TCP.",
